    "New settled-node API defaults to Single, observed live x87 control007F. Explicit Single/Double arithmetic rounds each operation to24/53-bit significands; Single retains wide exponents until native binary32 memory stores. Existing composition/writeback API defaults remain Double pending caller-specific migration.",
    "Finite stores share the reviewed nearest-even overflow-midpoint guard. Unknown precision values reject. Seven new tests cover child frame semantics and single-precision ties, wide-exponent cancellation and tiny products."
  ],
